WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Zinger, Hazelnut

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.370
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.540
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.300
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:19.820
My queen, thank you.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:31.820
-Congratulations, Your Majesty!
-Congratulations, Your Majesty!

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:36.690
I will become a father!

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.540
I

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.500
pregnant?

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.890
Stop it!

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.350
-God.
-Get out of here.

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:26.080
-Your Majesty.
-God.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.720
Why is the queen so upset?

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.660
She's not upset.

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:48.210
This is how she expresses her joy.

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.000
Yes.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:57.100
Is this a side effect of pregnancy?

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:03.080
This is more than a failure of self-identification.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.980
My personality will disappear and my soul will disappear.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.220
Is this how my life will end?

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:16.500
I told you that I am against marriage.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.470
Even if by chance I ended up married,

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:20.070
I didn't want to have children.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:23.100
It's hard for me to survive alone
in this hostile world,

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.310
what kind of pregnancy?

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.440
As reckless as taking off your body armor

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.670
and dance samba under fire.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:30.970
And that's not all.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.940
Pregnancy and childbirth shorten life expectancy.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.540
You give up your life,
for the child to live.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.690
I have to give up my life

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.620
for the sake of a child I don’t even know?

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:46.850
Damn Mother Nature, grant someone else procreation!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:57.200
I can't believe I'm pregnant!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.720
Pregnancy is wonderful

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.980
Wait, Your Highness.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:12.660
Episode 17

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:19.320
You planted another body.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:22.400
Did you think I wouldn’t be able to recognize Ovol?

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:27.130
I did this so you would know

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:30.070
her true self, which she never knew she had.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:34.200
The Queen turned away from the Andonian Kims.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:38.170
The Andon Kims have teamed up with us.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:42.720
This is your chance to become queen.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:47.660
Don't try to control me anymore.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:55.900
How long will a bird tamed by humans live?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:59.900
if he leaves the cage?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:07.440
There is news that the king wants to convey to the whole world.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.600
Which one?

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.620
Queen

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.290
pregnant.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:41.580
This is a drum announcing a joyful event.

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:18.310
Now that my pantry is empty

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.480
there is nothing to fill an empty heart.

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:26.110
No delicacy will fill my stomach...

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:31.050
No, my soul. How to fill it?

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:34.200
I turned my back on my family.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.770
I'm a loner.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:42.140
Mister!

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.800
Mister!

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.510
-Mr!
-What?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.370
Urgent news from the palace.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:56.290
Did something happen to the queen?

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:59.850
The Queen is pregnant!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.790
What is the reason?

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:14.490
Your Majesty, instead of looking for a reason,

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:18.870
Maybe you can try to make her feel better?

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:22.010
Good idea. How to do this?

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.210
How to make a woman happy?

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:30.610
How would you know this?

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.890
And who should I ask about this?

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:41.220
That's why I

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:45.340
invited an expert to help solve your problems.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:09.290
Lately this was the only question he had been thinking about.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.270
What are you doing?

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.340
She'll probably be just as angry.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.970
And then you will say.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.710
"I watered my flower."

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.350
If I do that, I doubt I'll survive.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.110
So she is a girl with character.

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.290
In that case

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.520
there is an effective way.

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:40.980
Which one?

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:47.900
You make such a stupid face.

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:53.470
I hate myself for thinking the same way as him.

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:55.470
Sorry.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.910
There is at least some benefit.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.210
Can't be.

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:02.910
I realized how stupid it is to look for the answer from someone else.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.970
Only I know her better than anyone else.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.040
Why are you crying? It's me who wants to cry.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.770
These are tears of happiness.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.570
You can cry as much as you want today.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.340
OK. Cry.

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:43.250
You can cry for me.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:47.210
Shed tears for my life,

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:50.450
in which I have no choice.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.130
Your Majesty.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:10:01.040
Stop shedding tears of happiness.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.010
What else should I do?

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:08.140
You must notify the courtyard in person

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:10.070
and receive congratulations.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.150
Don't want. I had a fight with my relatives.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.340
Did you quarrel or not?

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:20.550
If you violate the established order, you will have to answer.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.680
So I hate pregnancy even more.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:28.050
The Queen Dowager has arrived.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:30.400
The Queen Mother is here too.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:32.870
They are ahead of you.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:34.900
What should we do?

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:53.290
Welcome.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:01.790
I should have informed you personally

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:06.460
but, as you can see, I can't get up.

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.040
What are my symptoms?

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:16.070
She's dizzy due to morning sickness

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.150
and pain due to pregnancy.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.150
Yes, that's right.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:23.840
That's why I came myself.

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.410
Please

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:31.320
sit down.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:32.630
Everything is fine.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:35.870
It must be hard for you. Sit back comfortably.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.730
Okay, sure.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.510
When I heard the news, I was delighted.

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:52.280
She even brought a talisman, although she refused them.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:55.070
I wanted to make sure

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:58.180
that you will bear a healthy child.

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:02.450
And it looks like a curse.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:08.000
I'm an atheist. I don't believe in talismans.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.230
You will realize when you give birth.

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:13.900
I want to believe in something I didn’t believe in.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.770
You'll fall into despair

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:21.170
and you'll want to make a wish on the rock that everyone is kicking.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.520
You don't have to be afraid of anything.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:30.910
But now you will be afraid of everything.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:34.620
Losing a child is bad for the mother.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:38.630
I asked the doctor to prepare medicine,

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.360
which will protect you from miscarriage.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.530
Take it strictly every day.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:45.090
If something happens to the child,

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.330
you will be responsible for this.

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.870
From now on, don't act rashly.

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:52.800
Be careful for the sake of the child.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.040
Both came to intimidate me.

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.710
I'm really going to be sick now.

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:24.140
Thank you for your wisdom.

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.310
This is Prince Yeonpyeong.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.090
Come in.

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:57.910
You came because you were worried.

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.070
I'm fine

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.610
but I can't bring myself to

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.880
congratulate the king and queen.

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:10.890
I have my own path.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.920
I came to the palace to help His Majesty.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.290
I thought it was the only way

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:21.820
to help him is to give him peace of mind.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.560
But when I saw the queen, I realized that I was wrong.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:32.540
This is your chance to become queen.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:45.950
Queen Mother.

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:50.320
To what do I owe such pleasure?

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:01.590
What brings you here, chief concubine?

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.330
You have teamed up with the Andonian Kims.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.070
-This is a desire of sorts.
-Do not trade in the clan name

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.670
for the sake of a petty fight.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.250
Do you want to remain a right advisor?

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.130
Make the right decision.

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:25.450
Otherwise, I will gather members of our clan,

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:27.690
concerned about the future of Joseon,

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.320
led by my father.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.670
Was this all sent by my father?

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.170
Yes.

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:46.070
Gifts for the baby you are carrying.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.020
And there is more.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:49.910
There are also gifts in the corridor.

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:55.730
This puzzles me even more.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:59.690
It's already dark, I'll light the candles.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.430
What's the point of these candles?

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:08.560
From now on my life

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:11.740
will become impenetrable darkness.

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.930
To leftist adviser Kim Seok-keun

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.040
The official was attacked again.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:45.240
They didn't behead the leader.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.170
They didn’t dare touch him,

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:50.040
because they were afraid that it would be seen as treason.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:52.410
Are these peasants so brave?

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:56.080
There is no reason to devote all our efforts to catching them.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.290
This worries me.

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:02.990
By the way, did they find the code of Tonhak's followers in the palace?

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.500
Kim Soyeon

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.000
Followers of Donghak
were able to enter the palace,

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.830
this is serious, you need to hurry.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:22.480
What if because we
didn’t do anything, will there be more of them?

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:27.650
Just focus on your assignments.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:38.580
Your Majesty, from this day forward

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:40.590
"Prenatal education"

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.230
you will begin prenatal education.

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:50.560
You should not lie on your side.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.700
You cannot lean on your hands.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:56.300
You can't raise your head when you're lying down.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:57.300
Crap!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:14.460
You can't laugh, be surprised, or be scared.

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:16.700
yearn, cry

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.790
and you can’t talk too much either.

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:29.510
You need to give up such unusual food.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:34.180
It's like my body doesn't belong to me!

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:36.540
Well, it's true, of course.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:38.020
But I just got used to it!

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:41.260
Why because of this pregnancy
everything returned to the original?

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:43.620
Especially you.

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:46.430
I thought you stopped pestering me.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:50.890
This is all for the sake of your baby.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.860
For the child to survive
I would like to survive first.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.200
Am I a machine for churning out babies?

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.440
A living incubator, or what?

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.770
By the way, I’m not the only one who has to suffer.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:58.900
What is daddy doing?

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:00.600
Go to Cheoljong, tell him about the training.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:04.640
In fact, in line 3 of Chapter 1 it says that

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:08.070
the father must also undergo prenatal education.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:10.290
As soon as His Majesty finishes his business,

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:11.950
you will study together...

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:13.520
My day started with pregnancy

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.080
and this is how it ends?

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:20.930
My life is already lost.

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:26.790
No, Your Majesty.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.600
This is not possible, Your Majesty. Take it.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.630
Hong Young.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.280
After that incident

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.450
Kim Byungin and the queen did not see each other again.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:41.750
After refusal he had to
find out that she is pregnant.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:44.580
I'm sure he has no one to rely on.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.420
Poor guy.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.470
Hope you eat well.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.090
Goodbye.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.600
You need to sleep at home.

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.640
You look exhausted.

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.960
Stress is the cause of all diseases.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.730
It will also be harmful to the baby.

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:31.000
Stay on your toes.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:33.630
Just one spoon.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:39.740
My pear wine.

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:45.340
Royal Chef!

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:52.460
Where's the pear wine?

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:55.760
It was spoiled, I threw it away.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.400
Someone is in a great mood.

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:20.140
I'm still the same as always.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.110
They said they stopped smiling a long time ago.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:29.690
And I found the smile again.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.390
I lost my wine
and you found a smile.

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:39.970
What a coincidence.

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:46.070
Tell the truth.

00:21:46.510 --> 00:21:47.780
You're having fun, right?

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:51.870
Take revenge for your suffering
as soon as the opportunity arose.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:55.680
You can't shake me, Your Majesty.

00:21:55.810 --> 00:22:00.220
Let him vomit. Spit out my wine!

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:01.580
Your Majesty, be quiet!

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.530
It's better to discuss everything, Your Majesty.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:05.120
Discuss, yes now!

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:09.820
My pear wine.

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:14.040
They drank all the wine.

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:17.240
- My wine!
-Your Majesty!

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:22.980
Give me the wine!

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:28.040
-Your Majesty.
-My wine!

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:31.040
Why are you crying, Your Majesty?

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:43.270
I've been waiting for you.

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:46.440
And you are cool, like a prince on a white horse.

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:49.710
Everything was forbidden to me, and you
you ride a horse and have fun.

00:22:49.710 --> 00:22:51.900
You are very upset today, as usual.

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:53.600
What a relief.

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:00.810
Let's take a ride together.

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:04.110
This is not possible, Your Majesty.

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:06.960
Her Majesty is carrying a royal baby.

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:10.580
You can't ride with her, Your Majesty.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:17.970
Your Majesty!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:23.060
Your Majesty, this is dangerous!

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:25.870
-Your Majesty!
-You can’t!

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:27.940
Oh no!

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:47.350
Where are we?

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:50.290
I always wanted to give you something

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:52.470
what you love and want most.

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:55.540
What cannot be found in the palace, only outside.

00:23:55.540 --> 00:23:58.240
-Fun?
-I'm talking about freedom.

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:03.370
Don't like it, or what?

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:09.750
That's what I would say, just a walk.
Why so much pomp?

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:13.220
We arrived at the royal estate
take a breath of fresh air.

00:24:14.080 --> 00:24:15.580
Let's go back if you don't like it.

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:20.530
A royal estate is like a summer house, right?

00:24:22.120 --> 00:24:24.560
Cute. It's like the rich man is flirting with me.

00:24:25.230 --> 00:24:27.170
Since we're here, let's take a look around.

00:24:27.830 --> 00:24:30.560
I knew you would like it, my queen.

00:24:30.560 --> 00:24:32.440
Right here.

00:24:34.180 --> 00:24:36.010
It's great to be a king.

00:24:36.070 --> 00:24:39.640
And a luxurious estate and garden.

00:24:39.920 --> 00:24:43.450
I've been wondering all night why you're so angry.

00:24:43.840 --> 00:24:46.720
Usually for the women of the palace
pregnancy is a blessing.

00:24:46.720 --> 00:24:50.080
But why was the queen so upset?

00:24:50.760 --> 00:24:53.500
AND? Do you know why?

00:24:53.890 --> 00:24:57.500
No. No matter how much I thought, I still didn’t understand.

00:24:58.470 --> 00:25:02.060
I don't understand, so I decided to accept.

00:25:03.360 --> 00:25:07.600
What grace is for the rest,
may not be the case for you.

00:25:07.980 --> 00:25:11.870
That's the kind of person you are.

00:25:14.310 --> 00:25:16.610
It seems that the Queen's dictionary is really useful.

00:25:36.130 --> 00:25:38.560
Why are you doing this? It's awkward.

00:25:42.900 --> 00:25:44.070
My queen.

00:25:53.490 --> 00:25:54.960
Is that "rrr"?

00:25:57.530 --> 00:25:58.730
Rrrrr!

00:26:05.320 --> 00:26:08.630
As I write the queen's dictionary,
I'm interested in something.

00:26:09.830 --> 00:26:11.600
What does "all in" mean?

00:26:12.330 --> 00:26:13.780
Did I say that?

00:26:13.780 --> 00:26:16.400
This is the word you shouted while gambling in the market.

00:26:19.720 --> 00:26:20.950
All-in -

00:26:21.040 --> 00:26:24.450
a very stupid thing to do when you're all

00:26:24.880 --> 00:26:27.110
You put fragile eggs in one basket.

00:26:27.810 --> 00:26:31.430
-Eggs?
-I did this stupid thing.

00:26:33.000 --> 00:26:35.500
Damn, at a time when you need to run,

00:26:35.650 --> 00:26:37.770
I tripped over a pregnancy stone and fell.

00:26:38.890 --> 00:26:40.500
Don't worry, my queen.

00:26:41.540 --> 00:26:46.070
I will definitely get rid of all the rottenness of Joseon.

00:26:47.480 --> 00:26:49.180
For our baby

00:26:50.370 --> 00:26:52.540
who will inherit the country.

00:26:54.950 --> 00:26:56.080
Fine.

00:26:57.720 --> 00:27:00.850
If this child becomes king
and will inherit the country...

00:27:02.080 --> 00:27:05.380
Can I gain absolute power?

00:27:07.960 --> 00:27:09.670
Sunwon World

00:27:09.670 --> 00:27:13.000
Soyeon's World

00:27:13.630 --> 00:27:15.630
Why didn’t I think of this before?

00:27:17.170 --> 00:27:18.440
-What are you talking about?
-My baby!

00:27:18.440 --> 00:27:19.630
Look!

00:27:19.870 --> 00:27:23.950
Everything under these skies -

00:27:25.640 --> 00:27:26.870
everything is yours.

00:27:28.980 --> 00:27:29.990
Let's go back.

00:27:29.990 --> 00:27:32.340
Now I will begin the real prenatal education.

00:27:32.790 --> 00:27:33.990
Real?

00:27:33.990 --> 00:27:35.990
I need to teach him how to win in battle.

00:27:36.790 --> 00:27:39.760
This little one will have to live in a hostile palace.

00:27:40.530 --> 00:27:41.650
Let's go, let's start already.

00:27:41.650 --> 00:27:43.730
We just arrived.

00:27:45.560 --> 00:27:47.770
Even if I write 100 volumes of a dictionary,

00:27:49.130 --> 00:27:51.560
will the day come when I will be able to understand her?

00:27:51.560 --> 00:27:54.780
-Wait! Wait for me.
- Hurry!

00:27:59.020 --> 00:28:00.520
Pregnancy Diary

00:28:16.310 --> 00:28:17.370
baby,

00:28:18.670 --> 00:28:20.480
to survive in the palace,

00:28:20.480 --> 00:28:23.180
you must gather reliable people around you.

00:28:28.780 --> 00:28:30.120
Your Majesty!

00:28:31.520 --> 00:28:34.020
They truly are the best warriors in Joseon.

00:28:34.390 --> 00:28:35.420
baby,

00:28:35.520 --> 00:28:38.630
you must keep your enemies close.

00:28:39.190 --> 00:28:40.760
A thousand warriors, you say.

00:28:41.960 --> 00:28:43.430
With such military might

00:28:44.070 --> 00:28:46.670
Are you going to take over the Songjeongjong Hall or what?

00:28:47.000 --> 00:28:48.470
Are you afraid?

00:28:50.740 --> 00:28:52.980
I think you're the only one afraid here

00:28:52.980 --> 00:28:55.080
once they prepared a thousand warriors for me.

00:28:55.580 --> 00:28:57.410
Reduce the number of warriors by half.

00:28:57.410 --> 00:28:59.410
The rest are in the royal guard.

00:29:00.050 --> 00:29:03.690
Baby, you must have your own secret treasure.

00:29:05.390 --> 00:29:07.520
These coins have just been minted.

00:29:07.520 --> 00:29:09.890
-How many are there?
-Million.

00:29:12.230 --> 00:29:14.730
Is this your investment in politics?

00:29:15.560 --> 00:29:17.370
Whoever has the money has the power.

00:29:18.700 --> 00:29:22.040
And finally, baby, the most important lesson.

00:29:22.700 --> 00:29:25.810
Get rid of everyone who is not on your side.

00:29:26.210 --> 00:29:28.410
Life is a game and the world is a jungle.

00:29:28.410 --> 00:29:31.680
You will be eaten if you don't eat the others first. This is a killer party!

00:29:32.310 --> 00:29:34.250
Of course you will try to establish peace.

00:29:34.780 --> 00:29:36.690
But if there's no hope,

00:29:36.690 --> 00:29:39.620
you must win at all costs, my baby.

00:29:43.030 --> 00:29:45.730
I'm so glad that Her Majesty

00:29:45.860 --> 00:29:47.760
coped with my anxiety.

00:29:47.960 --> 00:29:50.970
He hasn't been born yet, and you already want to tell him so many things?

00:29:51.770 --> 00:29:53.670
He will listen while he sits in his stomach.

00:29:53.940 --> 00:29:56.270
And it will stop as soon as it is born.

00:29:57.810 --> 00:30:01.110
It's time for you to go to bed.

00:30:01.610 --> 00:30:04.850
I don't have time to sleep: there's so much to do.

00:30:05.710 --> 00:30:07.420
Life is like a treadmill

00:30:07.420 --> 00:30:10.490
You only have to stop for a second and you will immediately fall.

00:30:11.920 --> 00:30:13.820
Even pregnancy won't stop me.

00:30:15.820 --> 00:30:17.390
Or it will stop.

00:30:19.600 --> 00:30:23.170
In my soul I have a motor, but in reality I have pedals.

00:30:38.010 --> 00:30:39.050
Long time no see.

00:30:39.480 --> 00:30:40.720
It must have been hard for you.

00:30:41.680 --> 00:30:42.680
Everything is fine.

00:30:51.560 --> 00:30:52.900
You have completed the tactics tutorial.

00:30:53.000 --> 00:30:55.230
These people never held weapons

00:30:55.500 --> 00:30:57.470
so they will be difficult to train.

00:30:58.200 --> 00:30:59.330
But the tutorial will help.

00:31:03.170 --> 00:31:04.210
Be careful.

00:31:15.650 --> 00:31:17.420
I didn't know

00:31:18.390 --> 00:31:19.890
that the number of followers has grown so much.

00:31:20.660 --> 00:31:23.030
In other words, many people

00:31:23.030 --> 00:31:24.960
found themselves in dire straits.

00:31:25.490 --> 00:31:28.800
Recently they have attracted a variety of classes:

00:31:29.230 --> 00:31:31.070
from ruined nobles to ploughmen.

00:31:31.400 --> 00:31:33.200
Perhaps, as the queen said,

00:31:34.840 --> 00:31:36.810
is our solution to abolish class divisions?

00:31:37.370 --> 00:31:39.370
We must beware

00:31:40.210 --> 00:31:41.640
fundamental changes.

00:31:42.950 --> 00:31:44.710
Of course, this is still a long way off.

00:31:45.650 --> 00:31:47.620
I probably won't be able to do this, but,

00:31:49.320 --> 00:31:51.650
maybe my child can.

00:31:59.960 --> 00:32:02.560
Your Majesty, His Majesty...

00:32:03.870 --> 00:32:05.100
Don't wake her.

00:32:14.440 --> 00:32:16.350
She's just like a child.

00:32:25.150 --> 00:32:28.260
Pregnancy Journal

00:32:28.290 --> 00:32:30.430
You must keep your enemies close.

00:32:33.860 --> 00:32:36.300
Baby, you must have your own secret treasure.

00:32:41.040 --> 00:32:42.540
Life is a game and the world is a jungle.

00:32:42.540 --> 00:32:44.570
You will be eaten if you don't eat the others first. This is a killer party!

00:32:45.240 --> 00:32:46.270
"Party"?

00:32:47.680 --> 00:32:48.680
Evening...

00:32:51.350 --> 00:32:53.450
I don't understand what "Inca" means.

00:32:54.050 --> 00:32:55.350
Party.

00:33:00.260 --> 00:33:03.130
Since the queen is fine, you were not harmed.

00:33:03.530 --> 00:33:07.130
I knew: the talisman I gave worked as it should.

00:33:07.500 --> 00:33:09.700
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:33:09.700 --> 00:33:10.730
I guess

00:33:11.400 --> 00:33:14.400
did you spread rumors like I told you to?

00:33:15.440 --> 00:33:16.510
Can't be.

00:33:17.440 --> 00:33:19.370
You've been gossiping since morning.

00:33:20.080 --> 00:33:21.910
Did you at least go to wash yourself?

00:33:21.910 --> 00:33:25.080
You should hear this. I'm sure you'll fall asleep right away.

00:33:27.020 --> 00:33:28.780
You know, queen...

00:33:33.120 --> 00:33:34.190
Just like that.

00:33:34.190 --> 00:33:37.930
What? Did His Majesty and the Queen pretend to sleep together?

00:33:38.160 --> 00:33:42.460
His Majesty and the Queen pretended to sleep together.

00:33:49.970 --> 00:33:52.340
I heard they didn't actually sleep together.

00:33:52.340 --> 00:33:54.310
They just spent the night in the same room.

00:33:56.580 --> 00:34:00.320
What? Then who is her child?

00:34:01.180 --> 00:34:03.220
Who is her child from then?

00:34:03.220 --> 00:34:05.450
-Can't be.
-I heard they were pretending.

00:34:20.300 --> 00:34:23.640
You must have heard the rumors circulating around the palace.

00:34:23.640 --> 00:34:26.010
Rumors are always one step behind the truth.

00:34:26.310 --> 00:34:28.110
This is an old story.

00:34:28.110 --> 00:34:31.510
To the rumors in the palace
not to be taken lightly.

00:34:31.510 --> 00:34:34.720
They can use them to bring you down.

00:34:34.720 --> 00:34:36.620
That's right, their goal is my overthrow.

00:34:36.950 --> 00:34:38.720
They play dirty and petty.

00:34:38.720 --> 00:34:40.460
I won't let them throw me out.

00:34:40.990 --> 00:34:42.320
-Yes.
- Hong Young.

00:34:47.260 --> 00:34:48.460
Why do you need a hairpin?

00:35:12.750 --> 00:35:15.390
What kind of defiant pose is this?

00:35:15.390 --> 00:35:16.990
The rumors need to be debunked.

00:35:17.490 --> 00:35:19.690
- Just look.
-Right in public.

00:35:19.690 --> 00:35:21.230
-How awkward.
-I can't watch.

00:35:24.430 --> 00:35:25.530
In that case.

00:35:28.670 --> 00:35:30.670
This is not enough to quell the rumors.

00:35:31.810 --> 00:35:33.180
Let's try.

00:35:33.180 --> 00:35:35.080
Isn't it too much?

00:35:35.940 --> 00:35:37.450
But I haven't shown everything yet.

00:35:46.450 --> 00:35:47.520
Not enough.

00:35:51.130 --> 00:35:52.990
Come on, keep going.

00:35:52.990 --> 00:35:56.900
If I continue, we will already need a tent.

00:35:57.830 --> 00:35:59.370
Is this what you want?

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:01.340
I didn't say that.

00:36:01.340 --> 00:36:03.140
We need to spark their imagination.

00:36:03.470 --> 00:36:06.170
Then for the same purpose

00:36:07.380 --> 00:36:09.210
I will visit Daejojeon today.

00:36:18.390 --> 00:36:20.720
I have no choice if I can be deposed.

00:36:20.720 --> 00:36:21.720
Then

00:36:23.020 --> 00:36:24.730
see you later.

00:36:36.370 --> 00:36:38.910
-Gone?
-They're so slow.

00:36:38.910 --> 00:36:40.710
Everyone is still looking at us.

00:36:40.710 --> 00:36:42.980
Then you leave me no choice.

00:37:04.230 --> 00:37:07.040
Your Majesty, the main concubine has arrived.

00:37:14.680 --> 00:37:16.280
Did you arrange this?

00:37:21.520 --> 00:37:23.890
-What are you talking about?
-I'm talking about rumors.

00:37:25.520 --> 00:37:27.790
It's all thanks to you.

00:37:28.760 --> 00:37:31.990
I remembered what you told me before.

00:37:32.760 --> 00:37:36.360
You said their nights together were just staged.

00:37:37.270 --> 00:37:41.470
Therefore, the queen's pregnancy will not be celebrated.

00:37:41.940 --> 00:37:43.770
Your words

00:37:44.070 --> 00:37:46.740
became an arrow and struck the queen.

00:37:46.940 --> 00:37:48.610
Please stop this.

00:37:48.610 --> 00:37:50.880
I don't control it.

00:37:51.110 --> 00:37:53.850
Once people start gossiping,

00:37:53.850 --> 00:37:55.950
and they can no longer stop.

00:37:57.190 --> 00:38:01.420
And it’s too late for you to relieve yourself of responsibility.

00:38:03.260 --> 00:38:08.030
While you are here, you cannot be free.

00:38:09.730 --> 00:38:13.870
Your existence will serve to bolster the reputation of our family.

00:38:14.570 --> 00:38:17.840
It's better to be the initiator than to be used.

00:38:21.610 --> 00:38:22.880
It's scary.

00:38:23.910 --> 00:38:25.080
Understand.

00:38:27.620 --> 00:38:31.620
But you're not alone, so don't worry.

00:38:40.930 --> 00:38:44.070
I'm turning into someone like you -

00:38:44.830 --> 00:38:46.030
That's what's scary.

00:38:47.770 --> 00:38:50.870
Do you know why Rod follows your instructions?

00:38:51.510 --> 00:38:54.110
Because you are an innocent victim

00:38:54.110 --> 00:38:55.940
suffering from the loss of a child.

00:38:56.640 --> 00:38:58.680
But what if you are a soulless mother,

00:38:58.680 --> 00:39:00.920
sacrificing her son to survive?

00:39:01.450 --> 00:39:03.920
And moreover, if you are a stupid woman,

00:39:03.920 --> 00:39:05.220
relying on a shaman

00:39:05.220 --> 00:39:07.460
regarding the future of our species?

00:39:08.160 --> 00:39:10.130
Will you remain in charge?

00:39:11.760 --> 00:39:14.660
I will write down everything I heard and saw here,

00:39:14.660 --> 00:39:16.660
so everyone in Joseon will know who you are.

00:39:19.800 --> 00:39:22.370
Words don't have that kind of power.

00:39:22.370 --> 00:39:25.410
You will still know their strength.

00:39:26.880 --> 00:39:30.150
One day you told me
that you don't want to regret anymore.

00:39:30.650 --> 00:39:32.050
You are not worthy

00:39:32.050 --> 00:39:34.420
regret the death of the late king.

00:39:34.780 --> 00:39:37.020
You should regret that you trampled on his dream.

00:39:38.220 --> 00:39:40.920
You, as his mother, should be sorry,

00:39:41.420 --> 00:39:42.720
that they ruined my son's dream.

00:39:43.320 --> 00:39:45.630
The late king must have really wanted

00:39:46.390 --> 00:39:48.330
come out of your shadow.

00:39:48.330 --> 00:39:49.330
What?

00:39:51.470 --> 00:39:53.170
You don't know anything.

00:39:53.970 --> 00:39:57.010
How dare you say such a thing?

00:39:57.010 --> 00:39:58.510
This is the truth known to everyone.

00:39:59.670 --> 00:40:01.780
And I'm sure you know this too.

00:40:03.480 --> 00:40:06.450
I won't let you ruin His Majesty's dream.

00:40:10.290 --> 00:40:11.420
This girl...

00:40:24.170 --> 00:40:25.630
I'll go to the Daejojeon Hall.

00:40:25.930 --> 00:40:27.000
Yes.

00:40:39.310 --> 00:40:42.650
They say that dreams counteract rumors.

00:40:43.950 --> 00:40:45.150
Rumors?

00:40:45.450 --> 00:40:47.020
I didn't tell anyone

00:40:47.020 --> 00:40:49.990
after all, a night with the king is an intimate affair,

00:40:51.490 --> 00:40:54.800
but if you find out, you will be very surprised.

00:40:56.900 --> 00:40:58.130
In bed...

00:41:23.860 --> 00:41:25.130
Something like that.

00:41:26.030 --> 00:41:27.800
You can't tell me about hot nights.

00:41:27.800 --> 00:41:29.600
It's a pity.

00:41:29.800 --> 00:41:33.800
The king is not at all what he seems.

00:41:34.340 --> 00:41:37.540
His endurance will go down in history.

00:41:42.610 --> 00:41:44.310
So it was because of me that it ended up in textbooks?

00:41:44.910 --> 00:41:48.780
Who spreads such false gossip?

00:41:48.780 --> 00:41:52.650
Only Royal Concubine Cho is capable of this.

00:42:01.660 --> 00:42:02.960
Everything is fine.

00:42:07.000 --> 00:42:09.870
What? Now why did you come to fight?

00:42:17.350 --> 00:42:18.810
Are you sure?

00:42:23.690 --> 00:42:25.450
We are sure that you are with the king

00:42:25.950 --> 00:42:28.520
can you fight them and win?

00:42:30.890 --> 00:42:32.390
This is my fight too.

00:42:32.890 --> 00:42:34.930
And I need a victory too.

00:42:44.200 --> 00:42:46.650
Then you need to practice archery.

00:42:47.210 --> 00:42:50.750
With your current skills you will only be a burden.

00:42:53.150 --> 00:42:56.850
Then can you teach me?

00:42:59.450 --> 00:43:00.520
I have

00:43:03.290 --> 00:43:05.160
there is no time for this.

00:43:08.900 --> 00:43:11.430
Your Majesty, Concubine Cho is here.

00:43:12.700 --> 00:43:13.870
Let him come in.

00:43:27.050 --> 00:43:29.050
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:43:29.350 --> 00:43:30.350
Speak.

00:43:30.350 --> 00:43:32.020
You must fulfill it.

00:43:33.620 --> 00:43:35.490
And what kind of request?

00:43:37.430 --> 00:43:40.760
Let me leave the palace.

00:43:45.070 --> 00:43:46.430
What does it mean?

00:43:46.870 --> 00:43:50.410
I cannot find myself in the palace.

00:43:51.040 --> 00:43:53.040
Please send me away from the palace,

00:43:53.610 --> 00:43:55.640
so that I can live my own life.

00:43:57.710 --> 00:43:58.910
I can't let this happen.

00:43:59.350 --> 00:44:02.280
You know what it's like to live as an exiled royal concubine.

00:44:02.280 --> 00:44:04.520
I don't care what they say about me.

00:44:04.520 --> 00:44:08.460
I won't be bound by this anymore.

00:44:10.390 --> 00:44:14.130
This is my last request
please satisfy her.

00:44:20.700 --> 00:44:23.070
I do not give my permission. I can't give it.

00:44:23.970 --> 00:44:26.210
We valued each other

00:44:27.240 --> 00:44:29.480
but our love is no more.

00:44:30.140 --> 00:44:31.550
In the palace

00:44:32.410 --> 00:44:34.080
I'm in captivity

00:44:35.150 --> 00:44:37.750
under the name of the royal concubine.

00:45:19.430 --> 00:45:23.060
Your Majesty. All officials are assembled.

00:45:26.430 --> 00:45:31.040
The reason I had to gather you

00:45:33.710 --> 00:45:36.310
is that I have an important announcement to make.

00:45:44.050 --> 00:45:46.150
From now on

00:45:46.890 --> 00:45:49.890
Cho Hwajin, royal consort

00:45:54.560 --> 00:45:56.230
loses her status as a royal concubine.

00:46:04.710 --> 00:46:06.240
We must stop this.

00:46:07.380 --> 00:46:11.780
The royal concubine is no longer one of us.

00:46:17.290 --> 00:46:20.790
Your Majesty, be healthy.

00:46:22.060 --> 00:46:25.930
I will pray for you.

00:46:45.210 --> 00:46:46.380
Your Highness.

00:46:53.420 --> 00:46:56.490
Please don't call me that anymore.

00:46:56.490 --> 00:46:57.890
This is a mistake.

00:46:59.060 --> 00:47:00.460
A king shouldn't do this to you.

00:47:00.460 --> 00:47:02.230
I asked him myself.

00:47:04.130 --> 00:47:06.930
-For what?
-It's better for everyone.

00:47:07.840 --> 00:47:11.240
While I'm in the palace, I'll disturb the king,

00:47:11.710 --> 00:47:13.840
without wanting it.

00:47:13.840 --> 00:47:15.780
I'll make sure something like this doesn't happen.

00:47:16.510 --> 00:47:18.150
It's not too late to return.

00:47:18.150 --> 00:47:19.880
I'll go tell the king...

00:47:21.850 --> 00:47:23.990
I don't trust myself anymore.

00:47:25.090 --> 00:47:29.290
If I stay here any longer, I will completely lose myself.

00:47:30.990 --> 00:47:34.530
I pretended I didn't know

00:47:35.760 --> 00:47:38.000
about your feelings for me.

00:47:41.670 --> 00:47:44.370
-Your Highness.
-I used you for my own purposes.

00:47:45.870 --> 00:47:48.280
When I longed for a king

00:47:49.110 --> 00:47:51.980
the emptiness that he didn't miss me,

00:47:53.080 --> 00:47:55.080
I filled it in with you.

00:47:55.450 --> 00:47:56.620
I

00:47:59.520 --> 00:48:01.960
willingly allowed you to use me.

00:48:03.390 --> 00:48:05.190
Only this I could do

00:48:07.330 --> 00:48:08.600
for you.

00:48:09.630 --> 00:48:11.170
Thank you.

00:48:12.570 --> 00:48:13.700
And

00:48:14.970 --> 00:48:16.500
sorry.

00:48:17.510 --> 00:48:19.310
It's time for you to stop

00:48:19.670 --> 00:48:23.010
hurt yourself by loving the wrong person.

00:48:43.260 --> 00:48:45.670
So that's what she meant.

00:48:52.170 --> 00:48:53.940
Cool woman.

00:48:57.310 --> 00:48:58.910
Is Cheoljong okay?

00:49:00.780 --> 00:49:02.580
I'm sure not.

00:49:25.670 --> 00:49:27.210
Fight me.

00:49:27.480 --> 00:49:28.780
I'm not in the mood.

00:49:28.940 --> 00:49:29.980
As a child

00:49:31.210 --> 00:49:33.410
We often played the same game in Ganghwado.

00:49:35.880 --> 00:49:38.590
In which the one who first steps on the shadow of another will win.

00:49:39.350 --> 00:49:40.790
The one who doesn't want to play

00:49:42.790 --> 00:49:44.330
loses immediately.

00:50:09.120 --> 00:50:10.520
Remember?

00:50:11.220 --> 00:50:14.660
As a child, I always won.

00:50:17.930 --> 00:50:20.860
I remember that later I always won.

00:50:24.230 --> 00:50:28.340
I should have done it sooner
be stricter with our hierarchy.

00:50:28.640 --> 00:50:31.640
Hierarchy had nothing to do with it, you just couldn't win.

00:50:40.610 --> 00:50:44.690
Concubine Cho was worried about you until the end.

00:50:44.850 --> 00:50:47.220
You don't even understand how valuable it is.

00:50:47.220 --> 00:50:48.360
I still understand.

00:50:49.160 --> 00:50:50.590
That's why I suffer so much.

00:51:02.200 --> 00:51:03.570
You must suffer more.

00:51:04.440 --> 00:51:05.510
This is the best

00:51:07.410 --> 00:51:09.480
what can you do for her.

00:51:17.450 --> 00:51:20.090
How much longer do I have to suffer?
from loneliness and worry?

00:51:20.590 --> 00:51:21.920
How much longer?

00:51:35.960 --> 00:51:39.300
Is my Cheoljung drinking somewhere?

00:51:39.830 --> 00:51:42.070
It would be better if I drank with him, if not for pregnancy.

00:51:47.110 --> 00:51:51.180
Is pregnancy not only about bearing a child, but also about becoming one?

00:51:52.350 --> 00:51:54.320
Why are you so sleepy all the time?

00:52:10.030 --> 00:52:11.470
I'll go to the Dongmyeongjong Hall.

00:52:13.030 --> 00:52:14.200
Be careful, Your Majesty.

00:52:14.770 --> 00:52:16.400
The rumor is dangerous

00:52:16.400 --> 00:52:19.070
if they find out that he left you...

00:52:19.940 --> 00:52:22.910
Until the Queen Dowager found out

00:52:23.410 --> 00:52:25.310
I have to tell her myself.

00:52:26.210 --> 00:52:28.350
-But..
-Don't worry.

00:52:29.080 --> 00:52:32.090
They can't even imagine

00:52:32.090 --> 00:52:33.890
that I will share a rumor that I started.

00:52:37.860 --> 00:52:40.330
She showed up without an invitation.

00:52:40.690 --> 00:52:42.700
Probably asking for a favor again.

00:52:42.700 --> 00:52:45.000
I've heard some amazing rumors.

00:52:45.000 --> 00:52:48.140
I was afraid that you might fall ill from such news.

00:52:48.540 --> 00:52:50.840
That's why I came right away.

00:52:50.840 --> 00:52:52.210
Rumors?

00:52:54.480 --> 00:52:58.450
Why so much effort?

00:52:58.450 --> 00:53:02.380
If you knew what we were talking about, you wouldn’t talk like that.

00:53:03.320 --> 00:53:04.750
Even curious.

00:53:05.090 --> 00:53:08.490
What kind of rumor is this that you rushed like mad?

00:53:09.390 --> 00:53:12.260
He's too good to miss

00:53:12.560 --> 00:53:16.030
how your face will change when you hear it.

00:53:18.300 --> 00:53:20.400
It's unlikely that rumors will change my face like this

00:53:20.400 --> 00:53:22.870
how you long to see.

00:53:25.140 --> 00:53:29.810
The queen's child is not the king's.

00:53:31.180 --> 00:53:34.780
It's from Kim Byungin.

00:53:36.920 --> 00:53:40.190
You cared so much about your family.

00:53:40.450 --> 00:53:44.860
Now it will go down in history that the Andonian Kim clan

00:53:44.860 --> 00:53:47.290
stained the royal blood.

00:54:00.640 --> 00:54:01.780
Interesting.

00:54:02.880 --> 00:54:05.050
Now things have become even more interesting.

00:54:14.990 --> 00:54:16.790
Did you hear what they were saying?

00:54:17.160 --> 00:54:19.290
Yes, I heard it. Unfounded.

00:54:19.660 --> 00:54:22.500
The king and queen slept together

00:54:23.200 --> 00:54:26.970
as expected.
Why are you talking about this so late?

00:54:26.970 --> 00:54:28.340
Yes, that’s not what I’m talking about at all.

00:54:28.600 --> 00:54:30.900
They say the child is not the king's.

00:54:31.240 --> 00:54:32.670
Hush, you'll bring trouble on yourself.

00:54:43.280 --> 00:54:45.920
The whole courtyard laughs at our clan.

00:54:46.690 --> 00:54:50.320
Communication between the Queen and the Minister of War, close relatives?

00:54:51.090 --> 00:54:53.330
I had high hopes for him.

00:54:54.190 --> 00:54:55.630
What a shame.

00:54:57.130 --> 00:54:58.700
After the deposition of Concubine Cho,

00:54:58.700 --> 00:55:00.930
I thought I was finished.

00:55:00.930 --> 00:55:04.400
But after the rumors about the queen
I feel like I won.

00:55:07.270 --> 00:55:10.910
The child is not of royal blood, but a well-fed one.

00:55:31.530 --> 00:55:34.570
My family is more important than my life.

00:55:35.740 --> 00:55:38.110
That's why I live for my family.

00:55:39.440 --> 00:55:41.440
What do you live for?

00:55:41.810 --> 00:55:44.240
For the same reason as you, Your Majesty.

00:55:46.050 --> 00:55:47.080
Is it so?

00:55:48.480 --> 00:55:51.390
If so, are you ready to do anything for your family?

00:55:52.350 --> 00:55:53.390
Yes.

00:55:54.350 --> 00:55:57.490
Then first bring me the queen's head.

00:55:58.390 --> 00:55:59.890
This is an order.

00:56:01.400 --> 00:56:02.900
What is the reason?

00:56:02.900 --> 00:56:07.600
The Queen destroyed our family's reputation
which we have been saving for years.

00:56:10.800 --> 00:56:11.970
Your Majesty.

00:56:12.410 --> 00:56:14.740
I don't know what made you angry

00:56:14.740 --> 00:56:16.210
but please have mercy.

00:56:16.210 --> 00:56:18.110
Everyone in the palace is gossiping

00:56:18.110 --> 00:56:20.850
that the king and queen did not sleep together.

00:56:20.850 --> 00:56:23.750
Now they say the child is yours.

00:56:24.450 --> 00:56:25.490
What?

00:56:26.490 --> 00:56:28.020
This is not true.

00:56:28.020 --> 00:56:30.320
What everyone believes becomes true.

00:56:30.890 --> 00:56:34.290
As soon as morning comes, people will spread this rumor

00:56:34.800 --> 00:56:37.130
and the queen will become a sinner,

00:56:37.130 --> 00:56:38.770
who became pregnant by someone else

00:56:38.770 --> 00:56:41.940
and lied that the child was the king’s, thereby disgracing him.

00:56:42.970 --> 00:56:44.540
The rumors were caused by me.

00:56:45.010 --> 00:56:46.470
I will accept my punishment.

00:56:46.910 --> 00:56:48.310
Hearing can harm a man

00:56:48.310 --> 00:56:50.640
but he will kill a woman.

00:56:51.310 --> 00:56:53.080
To save our family's honor,

00:56:53.080 --> 00:56:54.650
I need the queen's head.

00:56:55.020 --> 00:56:57.720
If you bring me her head yourself,

00:56:58.290 --> 00:57:00.190
I won't punish you.

00:57:01.420 --> 00:57:02.920
I can't.

00:57:03.720 --> 00:57:05.890
Better punish me.

00:57:05.890 --> 00:57:07.260
He said that you live for your family,

00:57:07.260 --> 00:57:09.500
but all just for the sake of the queen!

00:57:10.930 --> 00:57:13.030
Then I'll entrust it to someone else.

00:57:13.500 --> 00:57:15.300
-Is there anyone outside?
-I will immediately

00:57:17.370 --> 00:57:19.710
I will return your regency.

00:57:54.610 --> 00:57:56.640
Your idea is dangerous.

00:57:57.880 --> 00:58:00.610
In a book with the queen's name

00:58:01.850 --> 00:58:05.050
I saw the code of the followers of Tonhak written by you.

00:58:10.190 --> 00:58:13.460
This dangerous undertaking has tainted you and the queen.

00:58:14.730 --> 00:58:16.800
They want to rebuild the country.

00:58:18.070 --> 00:58:21.100
What happens if the aristocrats sense danger?

00:58:21.570 --> 00:58:23.470
They will try to keep everything as it is,

00:58:23.940 --> 00:58:26.110
even if it means taking people's lives.

00:58:28.480 --> 00:58:31.450
The massacre of Tonhak's followers will begin.

00:58:34.310 --> 00:58:37.720
Then why did you come to me and not follow them?

00:58:38.620 --> 00:58:41.190
Because it will harm the queen.

00:58:46.660 --> 00:58:48.500
Kim clan

00:58:51.300 --> 00:58:53.600
aimed at Her Majesty.

00:58:55.970 --> 00:58:59.140
Having spread rumors that her child is from me,

00:58:59.640 --> 00:59:01.880
they want to kill her to preserve their honor.

00:59:03.240 --> 00:59:05.310
This is how they want to attack me.

00:59:05.750 --> 00:59:08.250
-I'll stop them.
-You can't.

00:59:10.080 --> 00:59:12.420
Even if you save her now,

00:59:12.790 --> 00:59:15.620
her own family started the rumor

00:59:16.860 --> 00:59:19.490
she will be forced to live with a bad reputation.

00:59:21.030 --> 00:59:24.160
Not only her, the child will face the same fate.

00:59:26.370 --> 00:59:33.340
Don't you understand that the officials who threaten your position will not leave her alone?

00:59:38.950 --> 00:59:41.250
Only you can save Her Majesty.

00:59:42.680 --> 00:59:43.820
How?

00:59:45.050 --> 00:59:46.920
How can I save her?

00:59:47.450 --> 00:59:49.460
Suppress the uprising.

00:59:51.260 --> 00:59:53.060
Personally

00:59:53.860 --> 00:59:56.030
punish Tonhak's followers.

00:59:57.400 --> 01:00:00.900
Slander against the woman of the king who went to war,

01:00:00.900 --> 01:00:04.070
in order to protect the country, is inappropriate, this will dispel rumors.

01:00:04.670 --> 01:00:08.480
If you prove your innocence by killing Donghak's followers,

01:00:09.410 --> 01:00:12.480
code found in the book
will no longer be a threat to you.

01:00:14.080 --> 01:00:15.250
This

01:00:17.180 --> 01:00:20.220
the only way to save

01:00:22.120 --> 01:00:23.790
the queen and your child.

01:00:28.530 --> 01:00:30.300
There is no time to think.

01:00:31.300 --> 01:00:33.830
In the morning the rumors will destroy the queen.

01:00:36.100 --> 01:00:37.470
There's no way I'm

01:00:39.770 --> 01:00:42.210
I won't let her suffer alone.

01:01:14.140 --> 01:01:15.680
I'm not sleeping.

01:01:16.480 --> 01:01:18.180
I just thought.

01:01:18.380 --> 01:01:21.180
It’s inconvenient, why don’t you go to bed?

01:01:21.380 --> 01:01:23.620
I came to console you.

01:01:24.750 --> 01:01:28.020
But I thought deeply.

01:01:30.120 --> 01:01:31.990
I want to sleep so much.

01:01:32.360 --> 01:01:34.330
I'll console you tomorrow.

01:01:44.200 --> 01:01:46.510
You are my consolation.

01:02:44.100 --> 01:02:47.100
The Sangnam uprising put the country in danger

01:02:48.130 --> 01:02:50.500
I need to leave.

01:02:51.910 --> 01:02:55.810
As soon as I leave, I ask you to take up politics.

01:02:55.810 --> 01:02:56.940
And

01:03:01.010 --> 01:03:03.350
take care of the queen and our child.

01:03:04.280 --> 01:03:06.950
I'm sure you'll handle this well.

01:03:07.520 --> 01:03:10.190
I felt good without politics.

01:03:11.760 --> 01:03:13.460
But what can you do?

01:03:14.260 --> 01:03:16.630
Don't worry about the queen.

01:03:16.960 --> 01:03:19.730
To take care of the one whose husband went

01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:24.440
going to war, risking my life, is my duty.

01:03:25.240 --> 01:03:26.910
I'm counting on you

01:03:28.140 --> 01:03:29.780
and I'll go.

01:03:31.040 --> 01:03:32.710
Take care of yourself.

01:03:35.280 --> 01:03:37.550
The sun has already risen.

01:04:05.910 --> 01:04:06.950
Your Majesty.

01:04:09.550 --> 01:04:11.180
Next is me.

01:04:11.990 --> 01:04:13.150
Your Majesty.

01:04:23.460 --> 01:04:27.070
Is it true that you yourself are going to suppress the uprising?

01:04:27.370 --> 01:04:28.500
Yes.

01:04:28.500 --> 01:04:30.000
What's going on?

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:32.710
You supported them, now are you going to kill them?

01:04:32.710 --> 01:04:35.580
Kim Byungin found a code hidden in the queen's book.

01:04:37.880 --> 01:04:41.450
If I don't do this, millions will suffer.

01:04:41.450 --> 01:04:42.780
I'll go with you.

01:04:44.750 --> 01:04:47.090
I have to go alone.

01:04:47.850 --> 01:04:49.820
Isn't it enough to have me hostage?

01:04:51.320 --> 01:04:52.730
It's a trap.

01:04:52.760 --> 01:04:54.990
Don't you think that the queen herself

01:04:55.300 --> 01:04:57.400
gave the book to Kim Byonin?

01:04:57.800 --> 01:04:59.830
You promised.

01:05:00.270 --> 01:05:03.140
If there is proof that she is the enemy,

01:05:03.140 --> 01:05:04.540
you will personally behead her.

01:05:05.000 --> 01:05:08.340
She should be beheaded, not other people.

01:05:08.340 --> 01:05:10.910
The Queen is definitely not our enemy.

01:05:11.780 --> 01:05:14.950
She turned her back on everyone just to be on my side.

01:05:14.950 --> 01:05:17.020
If I don't leave now,

01:05:18.350 --> 01:05:19.950
the queen will die.

01:05:19.990 --> 01:05:22.590
Calm down. This is not the time to quarrel with each other.

01:05:25.190 --> 01:05:27.430
You said I need to suffer more.

01:05:29.060 --> 01:05:30.200
Right.

01:05:32.830 --> 01:05:34.700
I'll bear it all.

01:05:37.240 --> 01:05:38.440
Your life

01:05:40.510 --> 01:05:41.710
in danger.

01:05:44.710 --> 01:05:46.150
If I try to survive

01:05:47.650 --> 01:05:49.250
everyone around me will die.

01:06:10.970 --> 01:06:12.640
I'm sure I saw him.

01:06:14.610 --> 01:06:15.780
Was this a dream?

01:06:21.510 --> 01:06:24.150
Court Lady Choi, Hong Young.

01:06:30.090 --> 01:06:32.460
Let's go to Daejeon. I missed the king.

01:06:32.560 --> 01:06:33.930
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

01:06:35.360 --> 01:06:36.860
His Majesty is leaving.

01:06:37.830 --> 01:06:39.530
Leaving? Where?

01:06:49.380 --> 01:06:50.840
Let's go.

01:07:14.330 --> 01:07:15.740
Wait!

01:07:25.580 --> 01:07:28.880
Stop! Wait!

01:07:35.820 --> 01:07:36.960
Why?

01:07:39.590 --> 01:07:40.590
Why?

01:07:47.370 --> 01:07:48.640
Is this the right path?

01:07:49.740 --> 01:07:52.210
I don't think this road is for people.

01:07:52.510 --> 01:07:54.440
This is the shortest way.

01:08:20.100 --> 01:08:21.270
Stand.

01:08:27.670 --> 01:08:28.840
You're late.

01:08:30.210 --> 01:08:34.110
If you were going to do it anyway, don’t hesitate.

01:08:34.450 --> 01:08:38.180
Will you get off the horse yourself or help?

01:08:50.100 --> 01:08:52.070
There is nowhere to retreat.

01:08:53.970 --> 01:08:56.000
We'll have to try.

01:08:56.000 --> 01:08:57.400
Don't worry.

01:09:00.240 --> 01:09:02.140
I can handle it alone.

01:09:05.240 --> 01:09:07.480
Everything will be fine if I get rid of you.

01:09:57.160 --> 01:09:58.330
How I became queen

01:10:21.350 --> 01:10:23.890
This baby eats so much.

01:10:23.890 --> 01:10:25.490
Say: "Daddy, come back quickly."

01:10:25.490 --> 01:10:26.790
I think he was kicking.

01:10:27.330 --> 01:10:29.860
Your Majesty, the King...

01:10:29.860 --> 01:10:31.930
Now the owner of this place will change.

01:10:31.930 --> 01:10:34.130
What's the point

01:10:34.800 --> 01:10:36.070
if you're not there?

01:10:36.070 --> 01:10:37.340
You said you were innocent.

01:10:37.340 --> 01:10:38.970
Being on the side of the weak is also a crime.

01:10:38.970 --> 01:10:41.240
Benin. How far are you going to go?

01:10:41.240 --> 01:10:44.480
The most important thing is to be born healthy.

01:10:44.480 --> 01:10:46.410
I will kill the queen

01:10:46.410 --> 01:10:49.480
who united with you,
to kill the king.
